menu "ESP-Mosaico peripherals"

config PXA_MOSAICO_LCD_PSRAM_DMA_DIRECT
    bool "Send contiguous output rows directly from PSRAM"
    default y
    help
        Reuse aligned, immutable scanout rows as SPI DMA input, as on
        DOIT GameKit 1. Narrow strided windows retain internal staging.
        Disable to use the original two internal staging buffers throughout.

config PXA_MOSAICO_NAND_FORMAT_IF_MOUNT_FAILED
    bool "Automatically initialize onboard NAND without a filesystem"
    default y
    help
        On startup, probe the onboard NAND and create a Dhara-backed FAT
        filesystem when FatFS reports FR_NO_FILESYSTEM. This erases existing
        content not recognized as a FAT filesystem. Valid filesystems mount
        directly. I/O failures and other probe errors do not trigger a format.
        Disable this option to preserve unrecognized NAND content.

endmenu
